		<description><![CDATA[There is growing concern that AI or artificial intelligence will ruthlessly enslave humanity.  These fears are real, and on the current path, very justified. Some background. http://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/video/2016/mar/16/artificial-intelligence-we-should-be-more-afraid-of-computers-than-we-are-video Lets separate this in to it&#8217;s two separate threats. The first threat is that AI achieves intelligence with no counterpart either in the human or computer world, and [&#8230;]]]></description>
