		<description><![CDATA[Civgene is the theory that humans with a metamind (more or less the conscience) evolved from psychopaths.  That animals the world over lack the properties of metamind (at least friendship, property, freedom, currency, and investment) and need not just intelligence, but also trust to accomplish civilization.  That civilization and it&#8217;s wonders (money, markets, specialization, economy [&#8230;]]]></description>
